R/helpers.R and inst/template_code/helpers.R include code by Lukas Wallrich
from timesaveR, retained under metaUI's GPL-compatible terms.
The bundled Barroso et al. (2021) dataset was extracted by psymetadata:
https://github.com/josue-rodriguez/psymetadata (GPL-3).
Barroso et al., Psychological Bulletin 147(2), 134–168; DOI 10.1037/bul0000307.
Dataset yi/vi are Fisher-z effects and z-scale sampling variances.
The synthetic inst/examples/tiny.csv fixture is original GPL-3-or-later data;
it is not an empirical benchmark and does not reproduce a paper.
Favicon SVG: original metaUI forest-plot artwork, GPL-3-or-later.

Bundled aksayli2019.csv: psymetadata, Hedges g/variance; Aksayli et al.
(2019), Cogmed working-memory training meta-analysis; https://osf.io/jhavp/.
Bundled coles2019.csv: psymetadata, Cohen d/variance; Coles et al. (2019),
facial-feedback meta-analysis; https://osf.io/v8kxb/.
Source metadata: https://github.com/josue-rodriguez/psymetadata/blob/master/R/data.R
